Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.28,0:00:19.37,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Furusupiido de mawari hajimeta sutoorii
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.37,0:00:24.16,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,akaku daichi someageru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.46,0:00:31.71,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chikyuugi ni wa garandou ni natta paradise
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.71,0:00:36.39,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Bokura no te de sukuidasou
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.34,0:00:43.02,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Hateshinaku tsuzuku sakamichi o
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.02,0:00:47.73,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima omoikiri kakenukete far away
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.68,0:00:53.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.40,0:00:57.28,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Tachiagare! Yuusha wa boku no naka ni iru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.87,0:01:03.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sobietatsu target makeru wake ni wa ikanai
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.79,0:01:09.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Moeagare! Kodou wa mune o kogashiteru
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.79,0:01:16.43,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Wasurerareta ashita torimodoshi ni ikun da
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.43,0:01:21.60,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Atsui batoru okose
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.88,0:01:33.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was totally psyched to go\Non a class trip to Kyoto,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.30,0:01:35.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but my trip was rudely\Ninterrupted by Blackboard
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.62,0:01:37.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Raymon destroying another Destiny Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.82,0:01:40.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I followed him and some\Nother strange Digimon, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.68,0:01:43.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shurimon and Stingmon were able to\Nsend them back to the digital world,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.56,0:01:46.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I had to do a lot of explaining\Nto Joe's brother and Sora's father.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.74,0:01:48.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they had their own\Ntheory about how magical
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.84,0:01:50.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,creatures have been known to visit Kyoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.94,0:01:53.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, if they only knew the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.42,0:01:56.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, Arukinima told us she\Nhas plans for a trip of her own,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.80,0:01:59.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to find the other five destiny\Nstones and destroy them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.72,0:02:02.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would totally\Ndemolish the digital world.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.43,0:02:10.06,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\fscx120\fscy120\c&HF7F9F3&\pos(311,321)}Protect the Holy Point
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.24,0:02:07.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy Point, protect!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.94,0:02:12.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There must be some kind\Nof answer out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.68,0:02:14.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who I am, what I'm meant to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.32,0:02:19.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alas, until I find it, I must follow\Nthe call of the Destiny Stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.64,0:02:22.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a pleasant drive, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.86,0:02:25.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it would be if someone didn't\Nkeep interrupting my thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.62,0:02:27.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'll look him up,\Nbut I'm close to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.88,0:02:28.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.24,0:02:30.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.15,0:02:31.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just concentrate on the driving.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.10,0:02:36.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yum!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.16,0:02:38.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll say. Mmm!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.86,0:02:40.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Snacks, your meat bread are sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.36,0:02:41.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's good and delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.42,0:02:43.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can eat them all day. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.10,0:02:46.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.44,0:02:48.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Save one for me. Just one!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.26,0:02:50.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never thought I'd see\NBlack War Greymon in Kyoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.96,0:02:52.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That wasn't in the travel brochure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.54,0:02:54.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand why he showed up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.92,0:02:55.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.83,0:02:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora's father said that Kyoto's\Nat a kind of crossroads where
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.28,0:03:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the spiritual world and our world\Nsometimes cross over each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.88,0:03:04.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why they built all\Nthose temples there to
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.26,0:03:06.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,protect this world from\Notherworldly creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.94,0:03:09.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they say that every\NHalloween night you can see
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.44,0:03:12.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,twisted ghostly figures\Nwandering the streets of Kyoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.80,0:03:14.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those stories don't scare me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.76,0:03:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though they wouldn't be something to\Nconsider if they're true, are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.76,0:03:22.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if a Digimon appeared in the real\Nworld, that's not just a child's story.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.80,0:03:25.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means the digital world's\Nplane is really off-kilter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.80,0:03:26.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.71,0:03:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But wait, if the digital world's plane is\Noff-kilter, why is it affecting our world?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.24,0:03:32.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.72,0:03:37.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Imagine this is the digital world, and\Nthis line is our world, the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.86,0:03:39.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Normally, they're kept separately.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.70,0:03:41.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if the plane gets off-kilter,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.82,0:03:45.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they start mixing together,\Nand then nothing is normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.54,0:03:47.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, even I understand now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.70,0:03:48.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank God, Oman.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.80,0:03:50.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She explained it. Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.02,0:03:53.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that dark ocean is another world, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.54,0:03:57.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not all. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.24,0:04:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd be willing to bet that there's a whole\Nbunch of other worlds out there as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.92,0:04:01.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.80,0:04:04.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like a rainbow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.14,0:04:07.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But look what happens if\Nthe balance is destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.80,0:04:10.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like it's all going down the drain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.20,0:04:13.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Black.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.58,0:04:14.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And in the end,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.84,0:04:17.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,every world might be covered\Nin darkness As dark as a
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.72,0:04:21.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Black cat at midnight. We can't\Nlet that happen. You're right,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.60,0:04:25.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and that's exactly why we have to\Nprotect the remaining Destiny Stones
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.90,0:04:32.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi Hey, Izzy, great timing Just hold on I\Ngot you a decorative dish towel Cute, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.02,0:04:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, thanks, Yoli, and I have a gift for\Nyou guys, too You hate the towel, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.42,0:04:40.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've written an algorithm\Nfor the D3 and D-Terminal
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.94,0:04:42.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once I transferred in,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.42,0:04:45.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll be able to use the D-terminal\Nto see the rift in the plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.62,0:04:46.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.14,0:04:48.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, Izzy, this is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.84,0:04:51.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can use this to track\Ndown Black War Greymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.52,0:04:55.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, gee, it's the least I can do\Nafter Yoli got me that neat towel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.42,0:04:57.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you do like the towel, yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.50,0:04:59.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go mop up Black War Greymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.16,0:05:01.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, I've got mail.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:01.78,0:05:03.24,email,,0,0,0,,{\pos(349,94)}Ken Ichijouji
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.06,0:05:05.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Geez, Kari, you'd think that I've\Ngot mail is your middle name.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.02,0:05:07.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Kari, check that later.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.68,0:05:09.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digital Gate, open!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.14,0:05:12.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go save the\NDigi-world one more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.04,0:05:20.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's Black War Greymon?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.60,0:05:22.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to teach him a lesson or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.26,0:05:23.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like three or four.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.88,0:05:25.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's over that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.18,0:05:26.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.30,0:05:29.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, I got sand between\Nmy toes. And your ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.64,0:05:32.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Destiny Stone almost looks\Ntoo beautiful to destroy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.40,0:05:34.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I must.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.74,0:05:37.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, I sure wish I could\Nfly and so do my poor feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.38,0:05:39.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're getting really close.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.24,0:05:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's about time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.52,0:05:41.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.74,0:05:42.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis, hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.04,0:05:44.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.42,0:05:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, hurry faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.92,0:05:46.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't wait for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.83,0:05:47.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on ahead. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.44,0:05:52.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Terra Destroyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.40,0:05:56.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My, my, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.20,0:05:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such power.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.70,0:06:00.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but he only nicked it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.66,0:06:03.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Terra Destroyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.14,0:06:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's a solid shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.58,0:06:11.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now only four stones remain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.42,0:06:16.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.02,0:06:18.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could this be it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.44,0:06:20.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The foe I've been searching for?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.52,0:06:24.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I'm drawing even closer\Nby destroying the Destiny Stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.60,0:06:25.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.80,0:06:26.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gee, I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.92,0:06:28.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only a hundred feet tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.46,0:06:30.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But whatever it was, it's gone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.90,0:06:32.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.81,0:06:33.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, this can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.04,0:06:37.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all my searching, my\Nopponent can't just run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.38,0:06:39.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.84,0:06:43.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must destroy another\Nstone to draw out my foe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.86,0:06:45.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is not happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.98,0:06:47.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, but I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.62,0:06:51.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what if that creature in\Nthe Destiny Stone gets loose
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.74,0:06:54.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then gets mad at us for\Ncreating Blackborn Greymon?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.66,0:06:55.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.94,0:06:56.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.42,0:06:58.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, you sniveling coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.92,0:06:59.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now step on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.54,0:07:01.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.72,0:07:03.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.54,0:07:07.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got here too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.48,0:07:09.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another stone destroyed. What'll we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.02,0:07:13.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this rate, they'll all be destroyed\Nbefore we can stop Blackboard Greymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.48,0:07:14.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.00,0:07:17.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way I'm going to\Nstand by and let some soulless
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.88,0:07:21.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,creature made from evil control\Nspires destroy the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.14,0:07:23.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want that ugly thing destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.52,0:07:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen TK so angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.80,0:07:27.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.54,0:07:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the tunnels.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.92,0:07:34.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's like there are two sides to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.60,0:07:35.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two people inside him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.16,0:07:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, we'll have all the Digimon in the\Narea locate the other Destiny Stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.80,0:07:42.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That should give us the edge\Nof her Black War Greymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.26,0:07:44.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So who is talking now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.20,0:07:47.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rational TK or the angry one?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.10,0:07:49.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And which one is the real TK?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.50,0:07:53.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It galls me to have been\Nso close to the opponent I
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.66,0:07:56.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so hungrily seek only to\Nhave him ripped away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.62,0:07:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.40,0:08:02.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.00,0:08:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hasta la...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.00,0:08:07.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, boink, but... Uh, see ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.90,0:08:09.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.02,0:08:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cody, don't you have kendo practice?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.14,0:08:12.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.12,0:08:14.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes, I do. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.04,0:08:17.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.40,0:08:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up with you, Cody?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.90,0:08:21.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You seem sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.00,0:08:25.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it Black War Greymon?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.90,0:08:28.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Pagumon. It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.56,0:08:29.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.14,0:08:34.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm worried that he and I will have\Nto DNA Digivolve together soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.08,0:08:37.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there'd be nothing\Nbetter, would there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.54,0:08:38.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.68,0:08:41.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I knew who TK\Nwas, but now it's like he...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.86,0:08:45.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sometimes it just seems like he's\Na completely different person.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.70,0:08:47.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe you're just getting\Nto know him better.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.60,0:08:50.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just because you see a new side to\Nsomeone, it doesn't mean it's a bad side.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.00,0:08:52.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at us, Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.16,0:08:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We change all the time,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.24,0:08:56.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't hear you complaining about\Nus getting you out of Tufts' graves.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.78,0:08:58.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless you do it when I'm not around.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.22,0:09:01.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't do it when\NI'm not around, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.30,0:09:05.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.78,0:09:08.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to stop Black War\NGreymon before he destroys
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.66,0:09:11.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the digital world and all\Nthe Digimon along with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.22,0:09:14.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon! Digimon, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.94,0:09:23.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.10,0:09:30.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soon we shall meet my nemesis, and I\Nwill find a purpose for my existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.44,0:09:32.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's scary up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.26,0:09:34.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to be afraid of.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.72,0:09:35.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just don't look down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.86,0:09:36.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.20,0:09:39.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I can't stop looking down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.50,0:09:43.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a few more steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.52,0:09:45.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Kari!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.80,0:09:49.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.62,0:09:54.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay now, Kari? Yeah. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.26,0:09:57.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm too slow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.14,0:10:01.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did the Digimon find where\Nthe other Destiny Stones are?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.36,0:10:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd bet my nine lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.20,0:10:04.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, undoubtedly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.04,0:10:11.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like it's me and you, Cody. Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.04,0:10:13.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't overlook me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.02,0:10:15.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, Gabumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.88,0:10:16.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.96,0:10:19.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a destiny stone\Njust over these mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.96,0:10:20.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Gabumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.98,0:10:22.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, a little hike never hurt anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.96,0:10:25.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, unless, of course,\Nyour boots are too small.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.30,0:10:27.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, there's something\Nelse I need to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.48,0:10:28.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems that...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.90,0:10:30.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can tell us, Gabumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.72,0:10:33.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Black War Greymon has a heart. He what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.22,0:10:37.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it may be hard to\Nbelieve, but it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.08,0:10:37.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.99,0:10:40.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, he's only made\Nfrom control spires, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.68,0:10:43.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, I know, but Agumon told me so.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.58,0:10:47.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No creature without a heart could ask\Nthe soul-searching questions he asks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.38,0:10:52.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then, why is he always fighting us and\Ntrying to destroy all the Destiny Stones?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.74,0:10:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This only he can answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.84,0:10:59.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how can we destroy Black\NWar Greymon if he's got a heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.82,0:11:02.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'd be like destroying you, Armadimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.44,0:11:04.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What should we do? No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.72,0:11:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to destroy Black War Greymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.90,0:11:11.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if he has a heart, it has been\Nturned evil by the powers of darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.90,0:11:14.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you let your anger rule you, TK?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.16,0:11:33.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be wary of the dark powers!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.96,0:11:35.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you guys! Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.96,0:11:39.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now let's go save us some Destiny Stones!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.46,0:11:42.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.98,0:11:46.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, TK, you can go\Nwith the others if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.16,0:11:47.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't bother me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.90,0:11:48.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.81,0:11:51.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take care, Gabumon. You too. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.22,0:11:57.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You doing okay, Cody?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.74,0:11:59.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.02,0:12:02.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll slow down a bit so\Nyou can keep up with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.38,0:12:08.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can he be so angry and full of\Nvengeance one minute and so nice the next?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.28,0:12:10.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.52,0:12:17.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would he really destroy Black War Greymon,\Neven though he knows he has a heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.02,0:12:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it is, the Destiny Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.88,0:12:24.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.98,0:12:32.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And this time we got here first.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.26,0:12:33.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is Black War Greymon?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.96,0:12:37.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Getting closer, 50 meters,\N40, he's inside the canyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.70,0:12:46.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here he comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.72,0:12:47.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.00,0:12:49.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,DNA Digivolution!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.40,0:12:55.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,X-B-mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.86,0:12:58.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stingmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.72,0:13:02.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,DNA Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.96,0:13:07.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Paildramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.28,0:13:11.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, digital monsters, Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.98,0:13:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to Digiball!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.96,0:13:18.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,DNA style!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.96,0:13:24.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aquilamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.48,0:13:27.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tailmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.98,0:13:32.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,DNA Digivolve, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.62,0:13:35.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, digital monsters, Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.02,0:13:37.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now let's jump in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.88,0:13:40.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,SILFYMAR!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.82,0:13:46.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,DESPERADO BLASTER!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.48,0:13:56.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your poor aim indicates you're\Nnot a worthy opponent for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.30,0:13:57.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now step aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.02,0:13:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can try to get past me,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.34,0:14:03.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I should warn you, the punch\NI'm packing isn't fruit punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.40,0:14:07.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.31,0:14:09.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You might think you're the\Nmost powerful Tokomon alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.66,0:14:11.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you're in for quite a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.54,0:14:12.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Static 4!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.08,0:14:16.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More money for more?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.90,0:14:17.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Static 4!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.00,0:14:25.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You fight well, but you won't defeat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.58,0:14:29.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, well, look who's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.42,0:14:32.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can take it from\Nhere, Black War Koromon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.56,0:14:34.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let him try to dodge this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.26,0:14:50.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now, to destroy this destiny\Nstone and summon my nemesis.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.38,0:14:54.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, Black War Greymon got\Npast Paildramon and Silphymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.24,0:14:56.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Paildramon, come quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.64,0:14:57.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.90,0:15:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you even know what the word aim means?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.22,0:15:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Desperate blister!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.90,0:15:19.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring it on, Arcane Mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.42,0:15:22.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, Blackwall Koromon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.78,0:15:23.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Destroy the stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.48,0:15:26.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is worse than the last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.18,0:15:29.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least then we didn't\Nhave to watch it blow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.26,0:15:31.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.44,0:15:33.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK, help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.84,0:15:34.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.26,0:15:37.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.17,0:15:38.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, Patamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.92,0:15:48.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patamon, Digivolve too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.32,0:15:54.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready, Armadimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.64,0:16:01.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digimon monsters,\NDigimon are the champions.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.30,0:16:07.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armadimon, Digivolve! Tantilloman.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.20,0:16:11.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.32,0:16:17.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon monsters, Digimon. And\Nthe big thing Era Destroyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.86,0:16:20.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angemon, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.82,0:16:27.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angemon, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.42,0:16:30.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's too mean to have a heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.74,0:16:36.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angemon, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.54,0:16:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fight, Angemon, fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.66,0:16:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There must be something we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.64,0:16:45.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's getting pulverized.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.08,0:16:47.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.24,0:16:48.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.40,0:16:54.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just like when Angemon fought\NDevimon and sacrificed himself to save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.40,0:16:58.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.36,0:17:00.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I can't let that happen again!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.70,0:17:02.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't lose him again!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.76,0:17:05.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blackboard Greymon is\Njust like Chimeramon,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.28,0:17:07.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a creation of evil that's\Nout of control that won't
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.56,0:17:10.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stop until the whole\Ndigital world is in ruins.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.26,0:17:12.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world will end.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.90,0:17:16.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does he mean the real world?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.68,0:17:20.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,T .K., T .K., you're right\Nabout Black Warp Greymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.14,0:17:22.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must be stopped, no\Nmatter what the cost is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.14,0:17:25.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me. Save the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.48,0:17:35.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angemon Digiball!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.42,0:17:40.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angemon Digiball 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.68,0:17:50.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, the monsters!\NDigimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.72,0:17:53.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Magna Angemon, Digimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.90,0:17:55.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Magna Angemon?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.68,0:17:58.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He digivolved to ultimate?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.34,0:17:59.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The power of the stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.26,0:18:05.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.58,0:18:08.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Static!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.49,0:18:11.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mummymon might be too slow\Nto get away, but don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.98,0:18:17.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've turned the tide, MagnaAngemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.62,0:18:24.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are made of pure darkness, and I cannot\Nallow you to stay in the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.58,0:18:25.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.80,0:18:28.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you to decide my fate?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.84,0:18:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand what a heart is for,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.08,0:18:34.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,unlike you who thinks it means\Nthat you can do whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.54,0:18:38.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your irresponsibility could destroy the\Nwhole world, so you must be stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.66,0:18:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now prepare to feel my wrath.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.40,0:18:44.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gate of Destiny
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.72,0:18:51.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here is the instrument of your doom, Black\NLord Greymon. There will be no escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.28,0:18:59.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back to darkness with you. You\Nare strong, and almost worthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.22,0:19:01.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To fight me
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.16,0:19:08.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I cannot win At least I will not\Nallow myself to be defeated by the
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.38,0:19:12.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,likes of you You shall find that\Neven if you think you've beaten me,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.10,0:19:13.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you really haven't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.08,0:19:14.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't we find out, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.50,0:19:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Terror Destroyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.70,0:19:24.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, now, that's what I like to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.98,0:19:26.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another one bites the dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.12,0:19:27.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.08,0:19:32.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And soon now, they'll all be gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.40,0:19:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've failed, T.K.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.02,0:19:44.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Destiny Stone's destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.92,0:19:46.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least he's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.18,0:19:47.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.70,0:19:52.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look! What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.10,0:19:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A Digimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.36,0:19:55.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, and it's in pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.98,0:19:57.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My nemesis.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.36,0:19:58.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Appear and fight me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.22,0:20:01.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Again, he retreats.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.02,0:20:03.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is taunting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.86,0:20:10.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must find the next destiny stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.04,0:20:13.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My opponent shall not escape me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.38,0:20:15.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Follow him. Right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.32,0:20:20.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.56,0:20:24.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Compared to seeing the\Ndestiny stone destroyed,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.12,0:20:26.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this bridge doesn't seem so bad anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.82,0:20:29.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good catch, Davis.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.02,0:20:32.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I had to make up\Nfor missing Kari before.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.96,0:20:34.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can pull her up any time now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.06,0:20:35.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.18,0:20:37.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, TK. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.82,0:20:42.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I understand now why you hate\Nthe powers of darkness like you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.26,0:20:46.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't hate them, but I'm not going\Nto give up trying to stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.26,0:20:49.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK, Cody, hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.60,0:20:54.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna rock your head\Nif you don't be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.88,0:20:55.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.98,0:20:59.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you coming, Cody?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.20,0:21:01.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.11,0:21:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can the Digidestined overcome their\Nproblems and defeat Black War Greymon?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.60,0:21:09.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch the next Digimon\NDigital Monsters to find out.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:25.13,0:21:31.54,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Asu e mukau kisha wa togireta reeru de
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.54,0:21:37.64,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Mou furikaeru bakari tomadou watashi
Dialogue: 1,0:21:39.06,0:21:45.54,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Te to te tsunagi awase issho ni hashiru to
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.54,0:21:52.75,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sou ookina chikara ga daseru no wa naze?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.60,0:21:54.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.62,0:22:00.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much for watching.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:56.25,0:22:03.25,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo itsu demo tsuuji atteru kara
Dialogue: 1,0:22:03.25,0:22:09.61,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo doko demo tonde ikeru wa
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.26,0:22:17.18,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo itsu demo minna ga soba ni iru
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.18,0:22:24.44,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Kitto kitto dare demo hitori janai wa
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.80,0:22:41.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The End.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.64,0:23:00.73,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,0)\fscx120\fscy120\c&HF7F9F3&\pos(313,319)}Assault! BlackWarGreymon

